WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.714 --> 00:00:11.354
Bench taken? With Premium, swap it for a close match, just for today. Your routine stays the same.

2
00:00:11.714 --> 00:00:12.674
Here's how.

3
00:00:13.031 --> 00:00:15.111
Start your workout as usual.

4
00:00:15.465 --> 00:00:18.825
Then tap the two arrows next to the exercise name.

5
00:00:19.178 --> 00:00:25.578
Try instead lists close matches. Tap the one you can get to, like dumbbell bench press.

6
00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:29.050
It takes the sets you had left. Type in the weight,

7
00:00:29.399 --> 00:00:30.359
and the reps,

8
00:00:31.087 --> 00:00:33.087
and tap the check to log it.

9
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.120
A new lift! Tap the Nice button. Next time, your routine starts with the bench press again.
